ps://x.com/JBSDC/status/1960278215714377993</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/JBSDC/status/1960278215714377993</guid><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Phil Magness]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1513218899789160453/ir8bJBRa_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Phil Magness (@PhilWMagness) on X</p><p>I’m now in the possibly-unique position of having (a) publicly opposed Lisa Cook’s appointment to the Fed board and (b) publicly opposed Lisa Cook’s removal from the Feb board, absent an actual finding of guilt.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/PhilWMagness/status/1960136132152455396">https://x.com/PhilWMagness/status/1960136132152455396</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/tuesday-assorted-links-531.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tuesday-assorted-links-531">Tuesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/PhilWMagness/status/1960136132152455396</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/PhilWMagness/status/1960136132152455396</guid><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[David Beckworth]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1742068566503854080/xYxDloEV_200x200.jpg"></p><p>David Beckworth (@DavidBeckworth) on X</p><p>Trump’s firing of Lisa Cook and his pressures on Powell are fundamentally about growing fiscal pressures. They would not be happening if debt/GDP were 50% instead of 100% and debt financing costs lower. Trump brings the drama, but fiscal dominance brings the motivation.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/DavidBeckworth/status/1960323021899485281">https://x.com/DavidBeckworth/status/1960323021899485281</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/tuesday-assorted-links-531.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tuesday-assorted-links-531">Tuesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/DavidBeckworth/status/1960323021899485281</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/DavidBeckworth/status/1960323021899485281</guid><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kalshi]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GzSHc5TWQAAn5nq.jpg:large"></p><p>Kalshi (@Kalshi) on X</p><p>JUST IN: Fed governor Lisa Cook, who was “fired” by Trump, says she will continue to carry out her duties Only 39% chance she’s out this year</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/Kalshi/status/1960340673392955601">https://x.com/Kalshi/status/1960340673392955601</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/tuesday-assorted-links-531.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tuesday-assorted-links-531">Tuesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/Kalshi/status/1960340673392955601</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/Kalshi/status/1960340673392955601</guid><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[The Great Postal Boycott must end]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://gopostal.substack.com/p/the-great-postal-boycott-must-end">https://gopostal.substack.com/p/the-great-postal-boycott-must-end</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/08/tuesday-assorted-links-531.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tuesday-assorted-links-531">Tuesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://gopostal.substack.com/p/the-great-postal-boycott-must-end</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://gopostal.substack.com/p/the-great-postal-boycott-must-end</guid><pubDate>Tue, 26 Aug 2025 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oliver Kim on central bank independence]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.global-developments.org/p/quick-post-whither-central-bank-independence?utm_source=post-e